# The mountains around Røros: Aursunden, Glåmos and Brekken, from Os in the
# west to the Swedish border, between Forollhogna (west) and Femundsmarka
# (south-east), which it slightly overlaps. A box around Kartverket's place
# names. EPSG:25833 metres, on the 2 km tile grid (700 tiles).
WEST=306000
SOUTH=6920000
EAST=362000
NORTH=6970000
# N50 county files covering the box (Kartverket names), for the no-go areas.
N50_COUNTIES="50_Trondelag 34_Innlandet"
